Error [jet.ProgramEntryMixed]: Top-level statements at `helper.jet:4` and `run: fn` at `program_entry_mixed_imported_statements.jet:5` are two entries of one program
  --> program_entry_mixed_imported_statements/helper.jet:4:1
    |
  4 | print("loaded")
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A program is script style, its entry file's top-level statements, or one `run: fn`, never both, so it starts in one place
 Fix: Move the statements into `run: fn`, or remove `run: fn` so the statements run
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0621
